+```bash
+{ sha256sum /audit-output/REVIEW.md;
+  find /audit-output/evidence -maxdepth 1 -type f ! -name SHA256SUMS -print0 \
+    | sort -z | xargs -0 sha256sum; } \
+  > /audit-output/evidence/SHA256SUMS
+```
+
+Exit status: recorded as `manifest.status`.
